"is 0."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví :term:`odtieň` farby. Povolené hodnoty sú od 0 do 360, predvolená "
"hodnota je 0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_overlay.rst:58
msgid "Saturation"
msgstr "Nasýtenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_overlay.rst:60
